concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-360ab a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "360AB Associate"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-360ab ;
    values:originalText "(1) For the purposes of this Part, an associate of a person (the first person) in relation to control of: (a) a facility; or (b) a company; is: (c) a partner of the first person; or (d) if the first person or another person who is an associate of the first person under another paragraph receives benefits or is  Schedule 1  Statutory infrastructure providers" ;
    skos:definition "(1) For the purposes of this Part, an associate of a person (the first person) in relation to control of: (a) a facility; or (b) a company; is: (c) a partner of the first person; or (d) if the first person or another person who is an associate of the first person under another paragraph receives benefits or is  Schedule 1  Statutory infrastructure providers"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "cc844537f9e318a27dd7c918298fe835fd9ac093109a63a4f5f4ba748be458b4" ;
    cof:pageNumber "9"^^xsd:integer ;
