doc:sch-1-sec-360ad-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "360AD(2) Control of a company" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) However, in determining that question: (a) the definition of associate in subsection 6(1) of the Broadcasting Services Act 1992 does not apply; and (b) the definition of associate in section 360AB of this Act applies instead. 360AE  When a person is in a position to exercise control of a facility" ;
    cof:pageNumber "11"^^xsd:integer .

concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-360ad-ss-1 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "360AD(1) Control of a company"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-360ad-ss-1 ;
    values:originalText "(1) For the purposes of this Part, a person (the first person) is in a position to exercise control of a facility if: (a) the first person legally or beneficially owns the facility (whether alone or together with one or more other persons); or (b) the first person is in a position, either alone or together with an associate of the first person and whether directly or indirectly: (i) to exercise control of the operation of all or part of the facility; or (ii) to exercise control of the selection of the kinds of services that are supplied using the facility; or (iii) to exercise control of the supply of services using the facility; or (c) a company other than the first person legally or beneficially owns the facility (whether alone or together with one or more other persons), and: (i) the first person is in a position, either alone or together with an associate of the first person, to exercise control of the company; or (ii) the first person, either alone or together with an associate of the first person, is in a position to veto any action taken by the board of directors of the company; or  Schedule 1  Statutory infrastructure providers" ;
    skos:definition "(1) For the purposes of this Part, a person (the first person) is in a position to exercise control of a facility if: (a) the first person legally or beneficially owns the facility (whether alone or together with one or more other persons); or (b) the first person is in a position, either alone or together with an associate of the first person and whether directly or indirectly: (i) to exercise control of the operation of all or part of the facility; or (ii) to exercise control of the selection of the kinds of services that are supplied using the facility; or (iii) to exercise control of the supply of services using the facility; or (c) a company other than the first person legally or beneficially owns the facility (whether alone or together with one or more other persons), and: (i) the first person is in a position, either alone or together with an associate of the first person, to exercise control of the company; or (ii) the first person, either alone or together with an associate of the first person, is in a position to veto any action taken by the board of directors of the company; or  Schedule 1  Statutory infrastructure providers"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1c797554ba1ee2f34c795e3b138885b84903c61243e0d7c8c89dddce8f583710" ;
    values:partOf concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-360ad ;
    cof:pageNumber "11"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Determines the question of control of a company under Schedule 1 to the Broadcasting Services Act 1992. A person is in a position to exercise control of a facility if they meet certain conditions." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
