concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-49 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "49 Subsections 360H(8) and (9)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-49 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsections, substitute: Declaration to be made available (8) If a declaration made by a carrier is in force under this section, the carrier must make a copy of the declaration available on its website. (9) If a carrier makes a declaration under this section, the carrier must: (a) give a copy of the declaration to the ACMA; and (b) do so within 10 business days after making the declaration." ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the subsections, substitute: Declaration to be made available (8) If a declaration made by a carrier is in force under this section, the carrier must make a copy of the declaration available on its website. (9) If a carrier makes a declaration under this section, the carrier must: (a) give a copy of the declaration to the ACMA; and (b) do so within 10 business days after making the declaration."@en ;
