concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-53-ss-17 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "53(17) Subsections 360H(14), (15), (16) and (17)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-53-ss-17 ;
    values:originalText "(17) The ACMA may, by legislative instrument: (a) specify the information that must accompany an application under subsection (15); or (b) specify the documents that must accompany an application under subsection (15). Note: For variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901." ;
    skos:definition "(17) The ACMA may, by legislative instrument: (a) specify the information that must accompany an application under subsection (15); or (b) specify the documents that must accompany an application under subsection (15). Note: For variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "40c05cece8200ed8273fd047fa67881ce1e1ba0f61dd1e243ad7abcaaacb52dd" ;
    values:partOf concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-53 ;
    cof:pageNumber "18"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "ACMA may specify information or documents accompanying an application under subsection (15)" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
