doc:sch-1-sec-73-ss-7 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "73(7) At the end of section 360HA" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(7) An application under subsection (6) must: (a) be in writing; and (b) be in accordance with the form approved in writing by the ACMA; and (c) be accompanied by such information (if any) as is specified under subsection (8); and (d) be accompanied by such documents (if any) as are specified under subsection (8)." ;
    cof:pageNumber "21"^^xsd:integer .

concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-73-ss-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "73(8) At the end of section 360HA"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-73-ss-8 ;
    values:originalText "(8) The ACMA may, by legislative instrument: (a) specify the information that must accompany an application under subsection (6); or (b) specify the documents that must accompany an application under subsection (6). Note: For variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901.  Schedule 1  Statutory infrastructure providers" ;
    skos:definition "(8) The ACMA may, by legislative instrument: (a) specify the information that must accompany an application under subsection (6); or (b) specify the documents that must accompany an application under subsection (6). Note: For variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901.  Schedule 1  Statutory infrastructure providers"@en ;
