doc:sch-1-sec-360kb-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "360KB(3) Statutory infrastructure provider for an anticipated service" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) For the purposes of this Part, if:  Statutory infrastructure providers  Schedule 1 Amendments  Part 1 No. 36, 2024 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Enhancing Consumer Safeguards and Other Measures) Act 2024 (a) an area is specified in a notice given by a carriage service provider under subsection 360HC(1) in relation to a real estate development project; and (b) the area is an anticipated service area; the carriage service provider is the statutory infrastructure provider for the anticipated service area." ;
    cof:pageNumber "34"^^xsd:integer .

concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-360kb-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "360KB(4) Statutory infrastructure provider for an anticipated service"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-360kb-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that: (a) subsection (3) does not apply to a specified anticipated service area; and (b) a specified carriage service provider is the statutory infrastructure provider for the anticipated service area for the purposes of this Part. Note: For variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901." ;
    skos:definition "(4) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that: (a) subsection (3) does not apply to a specified anticipated service area; and (b) a specified carriage service provider is the statutory infrastructure provider for the anticipated service area for the purposes of this Part. Note: For variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "eccb554c1e9909a44048f14d97ed3c3232dbcf743da60d807dc45f8248a2e17e" ;
    values:partOf concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-360kb ;
