concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-360sa a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "360SA Notification obligations of carriage service provider"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-360sa ;
    values:originalText "Scope (1) This section applies if: (a) a carriage service provider receives written notice from a person under subsection 360R(2) or (3) of a matter relating to a service area; and (b) the matter is likely to result in a change to, or the disruption of, qualifying carriage services provided by the carriage service provider to end-users at premises in the service area. Obligation (2) The carriage service provider must: (a) give written notice of the matter to each of those end-users; and (b) do so within 5 business days after receiving the notice under subsection 360R(2) or (3)." ;
    skos:definition "Scope (1) This section applies if: (a) a carriage service provider receives written notice from a person under subsection 360R(2) or (3) of a matter relating to a service area; and (b) the matter is likely to result in a change to, or the disruption of, qualifying carriage services provided by the carriage service provider to end-users at premises in the service area. Obligation (2) The carriage service provider must: (a) give written notice of the matter to each of those end-users; and (b) do so within 5 business days after receiving the notice under subsection 360R(2) or (3)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b073f6c68ef8721107fd9815b19b2c35ec111d526b75c2123d1111ba64424000" ;
    cof:pageNumber "48"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-360sa-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-360sa-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <c2024a00036.pdf> ;
    dc:source "c2024a00036.pdf, p.48" .
