concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-146 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "146 After subsection 360V(1A)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-146 ;
    values:originalText "Insert: (1B) Rules under subsection (1) may declare that a specified rule set out in those rules is a designated compensable rule for the purposes of this Part. (1C) Rules under subsection (1) may declare that a specified number of days is the relevant number of days for the purposes of the application of subsection 360VE(1) to a specified designated compensable rule. (1D) Subsection (1) does not, by implication, limit the power to determine standards under subsection 360U(1)." ;
    skos:definition "Insert: (1B) Rules under subsection (1) may declare that a specified rule set out in those rules is a designated compensable rule for the purposes of this Part. (1C) Rules under subsection (1) may declare that a specified number of days is the relevant number of days for the purposes of the application of subsection 360VE(1) to a specified designated compensable rule. (1D) Subsection (1) does not, by implication, limit the power to determine standards under subsection 360U(1)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8445d5cfe714f4491bdd7be3a32948e53e2a96ef2d6d75ca8d501fbc73a359c4" ;
