concept:c2024a00036-sch-2-sec-372jg a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "372JG Formal irregularities or defects in remedial notices"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-372jg ;
    values:originalText "A remedial notice is not invalid only because of: (a) a formal defect or irregularity in the notice unless the defect or irregularity causes or is likely to cause substantial injustice; or (b) a failure to use the correct name of the person to whom the notice is issued if the notice sufficiently identifies the person." ;
    skos:definition "A remedial notice is not invalid only because of: (a) a formal defect or irregularity in the notice unless the defect or irregularity causes or is likely to cause substantial injustice; or (b) a failure to use the correct name of the person to whom the notice is issued if the notice sufficiently identifies the person."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "7b2993880cb3b8ab6f1e8ad48653585c403fea3ea4e865b288765fa1b83dbddc" ;
    cof:pageNumber "73"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "A remedial notice is not invalid due to formal defects or irregularities unless they cause substantial injustice." ;
