concept:c2024a00036-sch-3-sec-1 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "1 After subsection 59B(1)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-1 ;
    values:originalText "Insert: (1A) For the purpose of advising the Minister, an ACMA official must, if requested to do so by: (a) the Secretary of the Department; or (b) an APS employee in the Department who is authorised, in writing, by the Secretary of the Department for the purposes of this subsection; disclose authorised disclosure information to the Secretary of the Department or the APS employee, as the case requires." ;
    skos:definition "Insert: (1A) For the purpose of advising the Minister, an ACMA official must, if requested to do so by: (a) the Secretary of the Department; or (b) an APS employee in the Department who is authorised, in writing, by the Secretary of the Department for the purposes of this subsection; disclose authorised disclosure information to the Secretary of the Department or the APS employee, as the case requires."@en ;
