    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-59da-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine one or more matters for the purposes of subparagraphs (1)(b)(x), (2)(b)(x) and (3)(b)(x). Note: For variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901." ;
