concept:c2024a00036-sch-3-sec-59da-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "59DA(5) Disclosure of information that relates to the affairs of a"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-59da-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) A disclosure under subsection (1), (2) or (3) may involve disclosing the identity of a carrier or carriage service provider." ;
    skos:definition "(5) A disclosure under subsection (1), (2) or (3) may involve disclosing the identity of a carrier or carriage service provider."@en ;
