concept:c2024a00036-sch-3-sec-59da-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "59DA(6) Disclosure of information that relates to the affairs of a"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-59da-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) Subsection (5) does not, by implication, limit what can be disclosed under a provision of this Part other than this section." ;
    skos:definition "(6) Subsection (5) does not, by implication, limit what can be disclosed under a provision of this Part other than this section."@en ;
