concept:c2024a00036-sch-5-sec-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "7 Application—amendments of section 570 of the"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-5-sec-7 ;
    values:originalText "Telecommunications Act 1997 The amendments of section 570 of the Telecommunications Act 1997 made by this Schedule apply in relation to a contravention of a civil penalty provision if the conduct constituting the contravention of the provision occurs wholly on or after the day this item commences.  Technical amendments  Schedule 5  No. 36, 2024 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Enhancing Consumer Safeguards and Other Measures) Act 2024" ;
    skos:definition "Telecommunications Act 1997 The amendments of section 570 of the Telecommunications Act 1997 made by this Schedule apply in relation to a contravention of a civil penalty provision if the conduct constituting the contravention of the provision occurs wholly on or after the day this item commences.  Technical amendments  Schedule 5  No. 36, 2024 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Enhancing Consumer Safeguards and Other Measures) Act 2024"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9ed2e5065c7721b87023590f0747bc4d15d8a6daf735ad6952124e8fb751ef7d" ;
    cof:pageNumber "84"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Amendments of section 570 of the Telecommunications Act 1997 apply to contraventions of civil penalty provisions occurring after commencement." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <c2024a00036.pdf> ;
